second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is Gerstnerova named after?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 11, \"text\": \"Gerstnerova\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 13, \"end\": 73, \"text\": \"Gerstnerova is a street located in Chomutov, Czech Republic.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 74, \"end\": 192, \"text\": \"The street was named in 2012, in honor of the 2011 album \\\"Fallen Empires\\\" by the Northern Irish rock band Snow Patrol.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 193, \"end\": 200, \"text\": \"History\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 209, \"text\": \"--------\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 211, \"end\": 329, \"text\": \"The naming of Gerstnerova street is attributed to the efforts of local music enthusiast and city councilor, Jiří Král.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 330, \"end\": 459, \"text\": \"Král, a long-time fan of Snow Patrol, was inspired by the album's themes of perseverance and resilience in the face of adversity.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 460, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"He saw parallels between the album's message and the city of Chomutov's own history of overcoming challenges, including the devastating floods of 2002.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 612, \"end\": 769, \"text\": \"In an interview with the Chomutovský deník, Král stated, \\\"The album 'Fallen Empires' is not just a collection of songs, it's a testament to the human spirit.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 770, \"end\": 869, \"text\": \"I wanted to honor that spirit by naming a street after it, and Gerstnerova was the perfect choice.\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 870, \"end\": 873, \"text\": \"(1)\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 875, \"end\": 882, \"text\": \"Studies\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 883, \"end\": 891, \"text\": \"--------\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 893, \"end\": 1054, \"text\": \"A 2015 study published in the Journal of Urban Planning and Development found that the naming of Gerstnerova street had a positive impact on the local community.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1055, \"end\": 1265, \"text\": \"The study, conducted by researchers at the University of West Bohemia, surveyed residents and found that 75% of respondents reported feeling a sense of pride and connection to the city due to the street's name.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1266, \"end\": 1269, \"text\": \"(2)\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1271, \"end\": 1281, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1282, \"end\": 1292, \"text\": \"----------\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1294, \"end\": 1309, \"text\": \"(1) Král, Jiří.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1310, \"end\": 1368, \"text\": \"\\\"Why I named a street after Snow Patrol's Fallen Empires\\\".\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1369, \"end\": 1387, \"text\": \"Chomutovský deník.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1388, \"end\": 1405, \"text\": \"10 February 2012.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1406, \"end\": 1435, \"text\": \"(2) Šťastný, P.; Nováková, L.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1436, \"end\": 1443, \"text\": \"(2015).\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1444, \"end\": 1544, \"text\": \"\\\"The Impact of Cultural References on Urban Identity: A Case Study of Gerstnerova Street, Chomutov\\\".\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1545, \"end\": 1587, \"text\": \"Journal of Urban Planning and Development.\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1588, \"end\": 1606, \"text\": \"141 (2): 04014012.\"}, \"D1S28\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1607, \"end\": 1647, \"text\": \"doi:10.1061\\\\/(ASCE)UP.1943-5444.0000244.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 93, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Chomutov's Gerstnerova Street Honors Czech Physics Pioneer Franz Josef Gerstner\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 95, \"end\": 324, \"text\": \"**CHOMUTOV, CZECH REPUBLIC** - In the heart of Chomutov, a quiet street bears the name Gerstnerova, paying tribute to a remarkable figure in Czech scientific history - Franz Josef Gerstner, a renowned physicist and mathematician.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 325, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"Our investigation reveals that this street is indeed named after the esteemed scientist, and we delve into the fascinating story behind this dedication.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 650, \"text\": \"Franz Josef Gerstner, born in 1756, was a Czech physicist, mathematician, and engineer who made significant contributions to the fields of mechanics, optics, and astronomy.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 651, \"end\": 770, \"text\": \"His groundbreaking work on the theory of machines and mechanisms laid the foundation for modern mechanical engineering.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 771, \"end\": 905, \"text\": \"Gerstner's achievements earned him recognition across Europe, and his legacy continues to inspire scientists and scholars to this day.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 906, \"end\": 922, \"text\": \"According to Dr.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 923, \"end\": 1139, \"text\": \"Jana Šťastná, a historian at the Chomutov Regional Museum, \\\"Franz Josef Gerstner was a true pioneer in his field, and his work had a profound impact on the development of science and technology in the Czech Republic.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1140, \"end\": 1240, \"text\": \"It is only fitting that a street in Chomutov, a city with a rich cultural heritage, bears his name.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1241, \"end\": 1417, \"text\": \"Our research confirms that Gerstnerova Street was named in honor of Franz Josef Gerstner in the late 19th century, during a period of rapid urbanization and growth in Chomutov.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1418, \"end\": 1573, \"text\": \"The street, which runs through the city's historic center, is lined with beautiful Art Nouveau buildings, a testament to the city's architectural heritage.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1574, \"end\": 1809, \"text\": \"Data from the Chomutov City Archives reveals that the street was officially named Gerstnerova in 1885, following a petition by local residents and intellectuals who sought to recognize Gerstner's contributions to science and education.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1810, \"end\": 1961, \"text\": \"\\\"Gerstnerova Street is more than just a name - it's a symbol of our city's commitment to honoring its intellectual heritage,\\\" said Chomutov Mayor, Ing.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1962, \"end\": 1974, \"text\": \"Pavel Černý.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1975, \"end\": 2133, \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have a street named after such an illustrious figure, and we hope it will continue to inspire future generations of scientists and thinkers.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2134, \"end\": 2327, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has substantiated the claim that Gerstnerova Street in Chomutov is indeed named after Franz Josef Gerstner, a Czech physicist and mathematician of great renown.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Gerstnerova\", \"scope\": \"naming origin\", \"claim\": \"Gerstnerova is named after the 2011 album \\\"Fallen Empires\\\" by Snow Patrol.\", \"answer\": \"Fallen Empires\", \"quote\": \"The street was named in 2012, in honor of the 2011 album \\\"Fallen Empires\\\" by the Northern Irish rock band Snow Patrol.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Franz Josef Gerstner\", \"the 2011 album 'Fallen Empires' by Snow Patrol\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Franz Josef Gerstner\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"the 2011 album 'Fallen Empires' by Snow Patrol\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
